{"id":"televisio_n","lemma":"televisión","pos":"noun","rank":1012,"glosses":["television (an electronic communication medium that allows the transmission of real-time visual images, and often sound)","television set, TV set, television receiver, television, (colloquial) telly (a device for receiving television signals and displaying them in visual form)","television (collectively, the programs broadcast via the medium of television)"],"ipa":"/telebiˈsjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"televisiones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/73/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-televisi%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"La televisión está encendida.","en":"The TV's on.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/50922"},{"text":"No veas la televisión.","en":"Don't watch TV.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440565"},{"text":"Deja la televisión encendida.","en":"Leave the TV on.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441952"},{"text":"Él está viendo televisión.","en":"He is watching TV.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443816"},{"text":"Odio ver la televisión.","en":"I hate watching TV.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448144"}]}